{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "781b25daffe2fd6fc48a99da1240f8f4eed987cfc578a58422cf2191445fe20e", "ja": "（今年もクリスマスが近づいてきた。劇場のみんなも、\nそれぞれのクリスマスを迎えようとしている……）", "zh": "（今年的圣诞节也越来越近了。剧场的大家，也都在准备迎接属于各自的圣诞节……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "59b4a07538b0aafc3c24bf315f722dd701ebc41f6a662ec77662ef34751eadfe", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん、みーつけた！", "zh": "啊，老大，找到你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "939d6c1be8fff7108cd1795740e275131ca4021f1a6e1cb7594dacb75cba3f6e", "ja": "ん？　環、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？环，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "8a080be27c0a266af69e1e52c35bfff318c3dcd36ff6421e3ac83d2e0338a345", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん。\nくつした、ない！？　うーんと大きいやつ！", "zh": "喂喂，老大。\n有没有袜子！？要特别特别大的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "eaed0678dabe50b206c59daccfe0cb79772c36f7fc5301e0f3c2edf20c9f1a56", "ja": "大きい靴下……ああ、クリスマスだもんな！\nでも、うんと大きいのなんて、急に言われても……。", "zh": "大号袜子……啊，因为是圣诞节啊！\n不过，突然说要特别大的，我也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "a7b3fd48e936cd31ea612a6a9f3f437999a533daa61f5aee061b5b82a0c2e137", "ja": "……ないの？", "zh": "……没有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "da85052526df00bb42a6a7432f991a83d8911645a35070f317a0d73a2f6f82aa", "ja": "い、いや！　たしか、前にディスプレイ用に作ったのが\n倉庫のどこかにあった！　と、思う！", "zh": "不、不对！我记得之前好像做过一个用于展示的，就在仓库的某个地方！应该……有吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "f43a772e930aa1704caeebf31651fb9df9fb994895c0a6d3f9fff437903f93f8", "ja": "ほんとっ！？　わーい！！　やったやった～♪", "zh": "真的！？　太好啦！！　成功成功～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7803e316bad218a6dba3d1173917c5b9489d38c86fd876f80b30d01c554726a9", "ja": "でも、うーんと大きいのが必要だなんて……。\n環はサンタさんに、なにをお願いしたんだ？", "zh": "不过，居然需要那么——大的……。\n环，你向圣诞老人许愿要什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "6da7fb842256564c0816300494d4084193c3730e2fad496938c07be553fd122e", "ja": "ううん、たまきのじゃないぞ。\nたまきのくつしたは、お家にあるんだ♪", "zh": "不是啦，不是环的哦。\n环的袜子在家里呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "08bb8d4d367c830c91799097d7cac464960cbde05b03fee2786e3da2d594ab8b", "ja": "たまきがさがしてるのはね、たまきのじゃなくて、\nこぶんのくつしただぞ！", "zh": "玉玉在找的不是自己的，而是小弟的袜子哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0076ba755a9e05cf08d927cfc9b8a4196537f84c757692d40608eb1ec5a9a97f", "ja": "こぶんの……？", "zh": "小弟的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "09d7a5929478d2edfeea3f7f6d5d9802bf8452c4a7408b36264a00912793cf93", "ja": "うん！　たまきがお願いしたのはレッドの変身\nベルトだから、ふつうのでだいじょうぶだけど……", "zh": "嗯！环拜托的是红色的变身腰带，所以普通的就可以了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "a2223201c5ff766ba7b352d20b60291506fb76d7c62924af29168096e6d4906b", "ja": "こぶんは、自分の欲しいプレゼントをいえないから、\nわからないでしょ？", "zh": "小弟们说不出自己想要的礼物，所以你也不知道，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "ea7c01994b53daf840257c9e491cc2d264c4ccefa9e8cd2876a9f023c3ec6232", "ja": "だから、なにが欲しくてもだいじょうぶなように、\nうーんと大きいくつしたをみつけてあげるんだ！", "zh": "所以，为了不管想要什么都能装得下，我要帮他找一只特别特别大的袜子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "17525b4d0f146ff767ad73cfcfd420f7c2dd06a79f7f5025f21fd54fc7a6bf3b", "ja": "……なるほどな。\nよし！　それじゃ早速、一緒に探しに行こうか。", "zh": "……原来如此。\n好！那我们现在就一起去找吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "2c1c687c9aaec7c75ba67a9616d0a5a2a18caa95ea619d0917ddec2edfbe5a42", "ja": "うんっ！　ありがとう、おやぶん！！\nよかったね、こぶん♪", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，老大！！\n太好了，小弟♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1017_kobun2", "source_sha256": "ce5b83d3210da4355f385a480f7177dccbd5dd353adcea58ed5ad05d5f5204d2", "ja": "ニャー♪", "zh": "喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bb435dc348d82cbe632246bcea23925bc4370b7e73deb93f494173bd1975a0e6", "ja": "うわっ！　こぶん、足元にいたのか……！", "zh": "哇！小弟，原来你在脚边啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "49d987610e2e844273fc6cff830eb571d74b38ef8a6768f89ed9d56cde0094a6", "ja": "くふふ♪　それじゃ、おやぶん、こぶん！\nくつしたさがしに、しゅっぱつだぞ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 那么，老大、小弟！\n出发去找袜子咯～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1020_p", "source_sha256": "4879f75052a8a3cb7fff5ab46935f8399ff2b0fffbf38f2338109db7c1e933ce", "ja": "（その後、靴下は無事に倉庫の奥から見つかり、\nこぶんの秘密基地の横に置いておくことになった）", "zh": "（之后，袜子顺利地在仓库深处找到了，决定把它放在小弟秘密基地旁边）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0143_1021_p", "source_sha256": "46bd8e32bd6ff76133478494d7b28af5e8114cb5dbd02ccaab5063861d2ac9f0", "ja": "（さて、中には何を入れておけばいいのか……\nあとでお店のペットコーナーに行ってみるか！）", "zh": "（那么，里面放什么好呢……\n待会儿去店里的宠物区看看吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
